elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">豆包工作任务模式上线技能、连接器与工作伙伴功能，转型智能办公平台</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness，开放AI编程智能体底层运行框架</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic正式上线Claude Platform的Computer Use、Skills API与Files API</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源 Qwen-UI-Agent 真机多模态基座模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9441ff3cea1797e0f581040dd68e13eb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源 GUI 智能体基座模型 Qwen-UI-Agent，旨在实现移动端、电脑端及网页端的真实设备自动化操作。该模型在 MobileWorld 测试中取得 82.1% 的得分，在自建的 MobileWorld-Real 真机基准上成功率达 92.2%，并在 OSWorld-Verified 及 WebArena 测试中表现领先。Qwen-UI-Agent 覆盖 100 多台真实手机与 150 多个应用，支持批量动作输出以缩短执行轨迹，并具备超长轨迹在线强化学习能力。在安全性方面，模型内置全过程判断机制，可针对支付、数据删除及隐私授权等敏感场景主动拦截并请求用户确认。该模型通过从模拟环境向真机环境的跨越，显著提升了 Agent 在复杂真实设备上的任务执行效率与长程任务处理能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云千问AI平台接入GLM-5.3与DeepSeek-V4-Pro模型并开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/368aa05201c9aff87be2716b08304668.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云千问AI平台（MaaS）近日完成模型矩阵扩容，正式上线智谱GLM-5.3与DeepSeek-V4-Pro旗舰模型，并同步对外开放配套API服务。GLM-5.3重点强化了编程、长程任务执行及网络安全能力；DeepSeek-V4-Pro则针对智能体交互进行升级，适配代码开发与多步骤复杂任务处理。目前，千问AI平台已覆盖文本、代码、语音、图像及视频五大模型赛道，接入包括Qwen3.8-Max、Qwen-Image3.0Pro、Wan3.0及Kimi K3在内的多款主流模型。在商业化层面，平台推出Token Plan套餐服务，支持DeepSeek-V4-Pro、Qwen3.8-Max等模型订阅。开发者可通过API将上述模型能力集成至自有业务系统，并在Qoder、Codex等开发工具中实现模型灵活切换，进一步降低了</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作任务模式上线技能、连接器与工作伙伴功能，转型智能办公平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8bb140131f33454b4f6258b393c4b73.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆包工作任务模式近日迎来重大更新，正式推出技能、连接器与工作伙伴三大功能，标志着其从单一对话助手向智能办公平台转型。目前平台已上架超200个技能与连接器，并支持用户自主创建专属技能以固化工作流。技能功能允许用户保存个性化工作方法，实现流程复用；连接器则打通了豆包与外部办公工具的壁垒，以飞书连接器为例，用户无需切换页面即可直接处理任务与查找资料。此外，工作伙伴功能提供数据分析、内容策划、科研及金融等领域的专业智能体，支持用户组建智能体小队协同完成复杂任务。用户可通过豆包电脑版侧边栏访问上述功能，通过技能留存标准、连接器调取信息、联合智能体协作，实现办公流程的简化与效率提升。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness，开放AI编程智能体底层运行框架</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dc7558b6757f99938aa45834da1392c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日全面开源Codex Harness，将驱动Codex智能体运行的核心框架向开发者开放。Codex Harness作为连接模型、用户与工具的Agent执行环境，负责管理任务执行、上下文、会话及代码操作。该框架核心包含Agent Loop、线程生命周期管理、工具执行及扩展机制。开发者可通过Codex App Server利用双向JSON-RPC协议将Harness接入不同客户端，获取实时事件流，从而构建IDE、桌面应用等定制化Agent产品。目前，该框架已支撑Codex Web、CLI及macOS应用等场景。OpenAI内部实践显示，基于Harness的工程模式可实现“人类设定目标、Agent执行”的开发闭环。此次开源标志着AI编程竞争从单纯的模型能力转向Agent运行时、工具调用及工程反馈闭环的标</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic正式上线Claude Platform的Computer Use、Skills API与Files API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日宣布Claude Platform的Computer Use、Skills API及Files API正式进入全面可用（GA）阶段。此次更新重点推出浏览器使用工具（Browser use tool），支持网页结构解析，可精准识别并操作特定输入框或按钮。Computer Use功能现支持单轮次执行多项连续动作，并符合HIPAA标准，可在签署BAA后应用于医疗工作负载。Skills API允许企业在代码执行沙盒中管理并运行专属技能指令与脚本。Files API则提供1TB专属存储空间，支持PDF及电子表格等文件处理，速率限制提升至原先的5倍，并具备自动过期机制。上述功能旨在赋能企业构建生产级智能体（Production Agents），开发者可通过Claude Platform调用，且电脑操作</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
